      "title": "Encoding must match on both ends",
      "items": [
        "asBase64/signatureIsBase64 pick Base64 or upper-case hex for the signature",
        "A mismatched encoding choice returns false rather than throwing",
        "Blank message, secretKey, or expectedSignature throws ArgumentException"
      ]
