      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Key handling is defensive",
      "items": [
        "The secret key's UTF-8 bytes are zeroed in a finally block after every computation",
        "Comparison runs through CryptographicOperations.FixedTimeEquals",
        "IHmacHashing has no ignoreCase parameter at all, unlike IShaHashing"
      ]
    }
